{"time": 1769616434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147935454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拜拜。\"挂断电话，进酒店"}
{"time": 1769616482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545512462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "可能是属性不合，所以并没有特别好的关系。横飞姬属性——混沌恶"}
{"time": 1769616581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063012544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（刷个牙）"}
{"time": 1769616588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395977122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "作为许久不见的老朋友，倒是一直有些联系，不过关系也就一般往上的水平，\"呼——\"办好入住的手续，沿着感知到的魔力往从者的方向走"}
{"time": 1769616609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722665498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅属性——中立守序"}
