{"time": 1769617953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063118111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（11）"}
{"time": 1769618164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346920977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "水晶之丘，是雪原市市中心众多高楼大厦中最高的一座。"}
{"time": 1769618259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707780554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一楼是旅馆及赌场的入口，赌场分布在大厦靠下的层数，而在莉维娅阔绰大方的出手下，工作人员给莉维娅开了接近楼顶的豪华房间。"}
{"time": 1769618294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850991366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "也正是适应了魔术工坊独立和安静的需要，远离人群喧闹的赌场。"}
{"time": 1769618328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117522665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而莉维娅感应到的魔力，正是源于雪原市市中心的成群大楼中，最高耸的赌场旅馆「水晶之丘」屋顶上。"}
{"time": 1769618362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760853169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "办好自己的房间就直接上到房顶。"}
{"time": 1769618423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553983006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "推开屋顶天台的门，大楼屋顶高度所有的略带寒冷的风吹拂过莉维娅的脸颊。"}
{"time": 1769618463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844592446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "映入眼帘的是天台边缘矗立的黑袍无名刺客身影。"}
{"time": 1769618475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552400788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那也是莉维娅熟悉的身影。"}
{"time": 1769618502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884503007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "只见那身影转身，凌厉的眼神扫过莉维娅的全身。"}
{"time": 1769618521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174967611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Assassin?\"偏了偏脑袋"}
{"time": 1769618629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084652267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100狂信子的察觉"}
