{"time": 1769623990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475287730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅只看到对面大楼的一扇窗户碎裂，但是里面并没有捷斯塔的气息。"}
{"time": 1769624001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501862959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（捷斯塔这个技能太阴了）"}
{"time": 1769624038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569491858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "既然已经没有了踪迹，自己也不想继续高调亮相。仔细检查一番令咒的真伪，离开回到自己的房间。反正接下来等着狂信子找过来就是了"}
{"time": 1769624043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169797171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（换命是可以连带着灵魂和外貌一起改变，之前最初召唤狂信子的时候就是人类魔术师的气息）"}
{"time": 1769624108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137181907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={14D8814E-584B-B0B3-CC6A-400E4C72EA3D}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-14D8814E584BB0B3CC6A400E4C72EA3D/0,file_size=1049377]"}
{"time": 1769624116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140562969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137181907]与此同时的狂信子。"}
{"time": 1769624194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219119379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么既然回到自己的房间，莉维娅花了一点时间简单布置了一下魔术工坊。"}
{"time": 1769624203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754633034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "话费了rd4个小时的时间"}
