{"time": 1769704091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631083519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"走吧～\""}
{"time": 1769704136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598355980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅关好门，并且上了魔术封锁，和二位从者坐电梯离开了水晶之丘大厦。"}
{"time": 1769704211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64632829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "警察局就隔了一条街不到，里的很近，在视野内就能看到警察大厦的外观。"}
{"time": 1769704215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182326120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=8D481958ACF982CAC158BF11E0938AE5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRqCpJe3N4XH17q2IXHY4Dj45IkARiR4Qkg_woonpzM-JWxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQOEgEDGyyOJKxy5q5ifwoanoC7c2CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=159889]"}
{"time": 1769704223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87674032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（夜晚模式的警察局大楼）"}
{"time": 1769704302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036834122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"收到了邀请的话，应该没什么问题。\""}
{"time": 1769704331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094118072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打个哈欠，\"如果不好好招待的话，我真得找弗朗索瓦问责了。\"光明正大地走进去"}
{"time": 1769704453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581457455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "门口值班的警员看到来者是三维少女，便径直走了过来。"}
{"time": 1769704486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839542031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“请问是莉维娅小姐吗？局长邀您前往办公室一叙。”"}
{"time": 1769704501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131321017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“请问这两位是…您的家属吗？”"}
{"time": 1769704554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95961865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对。\""}
{"time": 1769704568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708973432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"两位是我的亲友。\"笑着回应，\"局长在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1769704639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167420093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我来带各位上去吧。”"}
{"time": 1769704658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521691194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以过个魔力感知）"}
{"time": 1769704761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791810497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd70+30"}
{"time": 1769704761, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1791810497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D70+30={10}+30=40"}
{"time": 1769704809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047004217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（无事发生）"}
{"time": 1769704870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235993455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "警员带你们三位乘坐电梯，穿过走廊，来到了插着美国国旗的双开实木大门前。"}
{"time": 1769704889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267989130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这就是局长办公室了，我就先行回岗位了。”"}
{"time": 1769704974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565600767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"ok～\"和职员友好挥挥手，然后敲敲门"}
{"time": 1769705006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430415005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“来了哦，莉维娅亲！”"}
{"time": 1769705025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269223451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "门还未打开就能听到女童清脆的声音。"}
{"time": 1769705093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451254349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "开门之后，映入眼帘的是身高不足1m5的白发幼童，穿着一身可以算是情趣服装的洛丽塔裙装。"}
{"time": 1769705118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533138760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“有没有想我啊，真是好久不见了，让我想想，有几十年？还是几百年？”"}
{"time": 1769705130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326653065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后是局长办公室的布局。"}
{"time": 1769705158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560414201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"几十年，几百年，都不重要。\"摊摊手，\"倒是你，又换了个身体?\""}
{"time": 1769705258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354671078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=EE7C5B5ADAB093CC894DE8159F8AC0FD.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS_g7qHiXa9bJ4ek95T6kMryk-lhhjm6wog_woo9cTd6ZmxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ7sD4pPc7Xn4Nv8FJ8tHUe3oCvjaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=177638]"}
{"time": 1769705258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441963341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=35DE315CDC21988528D72F8EAD2093FA.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTSGKIelnzMEKIuUKcrZ54mPVuU2Bj_hwgg_wooo5jj6ZmxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQUdQKOg64HDnqBu-2jX2Qj3oC09WCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=132095]"}
{"time": 1769705259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73565049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E3C729A5C2B67856CFADD4E3C1222573.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTEMqF2HakzlokZgFJoHQPnW7PUbxiM3Qcg_woo1amE6pmxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQSOwtUgQszYA9W15CIxIbCnoC6UiCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=126604]"}
{"time": 1769705270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332806420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我还找到了白天的警察局大楼图片）"}
{"time": 1769705314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258040819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这办公室这么空旷)"}
{"time": 1769705361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470243616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "巨大的玻璃落地窗前只有一张相对来说比较小的桌子，而局长奥兰多·里维，在办公椅上起身迎接。"}
{"time": 1769705414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832958795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "除此之外墙壁上还有着美国国旗和各种警徽之类的饰品，但是相对宽阔的办公室，这点家具还是显得空旷无比。"}
{"time": 1769705433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373225282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（就是很空旷）"}
{"time": 1769705493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42368405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，这位就是局长大人了？\"礼貌地开口，\"初次见面，我是莉薇娅。\""}
{"time": 1769705508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355666461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1560414201]“当然了，这具身体我才用了三年呢，连内脏都十分干净，你要不要看一看呢？”"}
{"time": 1769705625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819731115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着，弗朗索瓦就想拉起自己的衣服展示给莉维娅，但是看莉维娅转换谈话的目标，又悻悻地放下衣摆"}
{"time": 1769705774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710345849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5E072DE85C85B2CB56AD48AC0FDEB8B1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTSpoNn4vcAl6PYvCfqKI4C2TkXHRjWlhgg_woohs_o35uxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQPSwS8op-Ryd2oFPj7pt4L3oCN0KCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=396118]"}
{"time": 1769705781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646207182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（如图）"}
{"time": 1769705845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824419312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我才不要咧。\""}
{"time": 1769705849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023010777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前就看过了。\""}
{"time": 1769705910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839613900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=42368405]“久闻大名，传说中的炼金术师，听说您是被弗朗西斯卡这家伙邀请过来参加圣杯战争的，那想必身后的二位就是从者了。”"}
{"time": 1769705928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979634016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "局长低头行了一礼，随后正经说到。"}
{"time": 1769706014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461880033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?你倒是看得出来。\"大方地承认"}
{"time": 1769706033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203740579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，我也不是什么有名的人物，弗朗索瓦，你说了什么?\"翻个白眼"}
{"time": 1769706034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652718196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“鄙人名奥兰多·里维。”"}
{"time": 1769706054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979867211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100奥兰多·里维对莉维娅的第一印象"}
{"time": 1769706156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161590882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1769706156, "type": "reply", "message_id": "161590882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=91"}
{"time": 1769706161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150796523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么好)"}
{"time": 1769706167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774546251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"幸会，奥兰多局长。\""}
{"time": 1769706508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525524104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "追加判定，为何局长对莉维娅感官这么好？\n1/3/7、横飞姬衬托的好\n2/4、横飞姬说莉维娅是个魔术师中的异类，比一般魔术师善良多了。\n5/6、听说了莉维娅击伤死徒的事。\n8、对于莉维娅这种不滥用力量的强者很欣赏\n9、莉维娅长的很像妈妈？\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769706618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702689292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769706618, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1702689292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=5"}
{"time": 1769706726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566654445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我从弗朗西斯卡那里听说了，早晨水晶之丘那一瞬间的庞大魔力，是您击伤死徒造成的。”"}
{"time": 1769706762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728757571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“并没有造成人员伤亡或者建筑物破坏，而且影响降到最小，做的真好，感谢阁下。”"}
{"time": 1769706788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55065456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "局长真诚地感谢。"}
{"time": 1769706821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240280082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来真的有那么大动静吗？\"扶了扶额头，\"我自认为处理得很快了，不过...虽然击伤了死徒，但...没能完成击杀。\""}
{"time": 1769706846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828350032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我看你是觉得昨晚南部沙漠那边做的太过火了，影响隐藏圣杯战争是吗？哈哈～”\n弗朗西斯卡在旁边拱火。"}
{"time": 1769706873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467631236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅很明显看到局长额头凸起了一块青筋。"}
{"time": 1769706937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976341166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1240280082]“虽然只有一瞬间，但那是相当强烈的魔力，几乎可以媲美南部沙漠发生的战斗了，阁下的实力还真是深不可测。”"}
{"time": 1769707007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041574050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“死徒这件事，就先交给我们警察局处理吧，听说阁下已经抢走了死徒捷斯塔的令咒，那想必大大削减了他的战力。”"}
{"time": 1769707034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680855374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哈哈...\"打个哈哈，\"我没那么厉害啦，和传说中的人物们相比。\""}
{"time": 1769707053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110074204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，不如说，一上来就闹得沸沸扬扬的，实在有违神秘的原则。\""}
{"time": 1769707215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741462619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看了看警察，又看了看弗朗索瓦，\"普通人很难处理死徒，这件事还是交给教会吧。\""}
{"time": 1769707310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420836152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=110074204]“有您这样想法的人如果能再多一些就好了，唉…”"}
{"time": 1769707443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945171595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741462619]“这点就不用劳您操心了，我们警察局有特殊手段。不过希望您能分享一下那位死徒的能力情报，于此交换，我会让警局在圣杯战争期间为各位行力所能及之事。”"}
{"time": 1769707546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152418002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...老实说，我也不算清楚。不过死徒们大多有很多条命\""}
{"time": 1769707788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820859460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不同的死徒也有不同的特点，至于这个...\"摇摇头，\"只能防范，没有应对的办法，暂时。\"随后想起了什么，开口，\"没关系，他的目标应该是我。\""}
{"time": 1769707928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187561983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“既然这样，那要不要今晚设下陷阱，围杀这位死徒，毕竟是人类的敌人，放任其在雪原市内行动让我们警察颇有失职。”"}
{"time": 1769708110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074432424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好了好了，你们别聊那个死徒了，难得的老友见面，倒是你们两个在那边一直谈正事。”"}
{"time": 1769708124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231457242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "弗朗西斯卡插进二人中间打断对话。"}
{"time": 1769708197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523496012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，莉维娅亲不介绍一下身后的二位吗？这位黑色的小姐是Assassin我知道就是了，但是这位金发的小姐又是？快告诉我嘛莉维娅亲！”"}
{"time": 1769708312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026536844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你真的想知道?\"笑了笑，接过这个话题，\"那你不妨猜一猜\""}
{"time": 1769708344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738663753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在这场圣杯战争中，已经有的赝作从者。\"走到艾蕾身边，笑着开口"}
{"time": 1769708387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298247646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“首先排除Saber，那就是…”"}
{"time": 1769708396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357539840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "弗朗西斯卡的猜测是？"}
{"time": 1769708425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037173354", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1、lancer\n2、Archer\n3、Rider\n4、Caster\n5、Ruler"}
{"time": 1769708456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525858112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1、lancer\n2、Archer\n3、Rider\n4、Caster\n5、Berserker\n6、Ruler"}
{"time": 1769708474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437532554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd6"}
{"time": 1769708474, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1437532554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D6=5"}
{"time": 1769708811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149215618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我看这位从者小姐一直不说话，难道是berserker？”"}
{"time": 1769708827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457461399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“谁是berserker啊，真是的！”"}
{"time": 1769708880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740858112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "刚刚还一脸笑容期待的艾蕾大叫起来。"}
{"time": 1769708929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629177377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“其他职阶都有可能但是berserker是绝对不可能的吧，我这样的美少女怎么会是狂战士呢？”"}
{"time": 1769708985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389821815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，回答错误。\"叉手，\"这就是所谓的ng，ng啦。\""}
{"time": 1769709034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325755048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"职介暂且不重要，重要的是...因为什么被召唤。\"笑意盎然，\"不过，也可以说是我比较有缘吧?\""}
{"time": 1769709177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668769620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那是莉维娅亲相当有缘啊，在这种情况下还能召唤出从者，为什么我就不行呢，可恶，圣杯太偏心了！”\n弗朗西斯卡直接在地上打滚。"}
{"time": 1769709232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062983884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，请容我问一下，这位局长也是御主是吧，那你是追求圣杯的魔术师吗？”\n狂信子贴近局长发问。"}
{"time": 1769709257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814423582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼，我可能就是有缘之人吧。\""}
{"time": 1769709357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501819464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，不逗你了。\"把人从地上拉起来，\"艾蕾亲，要我介绍吗？还是你自己来\""}
{"time": 1769709462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877991970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "局长被盯得有些发毛，开口：“我只能说，我作为警察，会优先在圣杯战争中保证一般市民的安全。”"}
{"time": 1769709494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336948978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“——如果这个答案能让Assassin小姐您满意的话…”"}
{"time": 1769709513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937870988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100狂信子的满意度"}
{"time": 1769709548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077432381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1769709548, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2077432381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=46"}
{"time": 1769709627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418302280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子对这个说法的满意度是一半一半呢，内心还是有些怀疑的程度，但是还是暂时放过了局长。\n局长也长舒一口气，心想这就是从者的压迫感吗。"}
{"time": 1769709660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712212330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只能说，我对圣杯没什么格外的追求呢。你们呢？\"眯起眼"}
{"time": 1769709719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745742803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=501819464]“不必劳烦御主介绍了，就算是暴露真名也无所谓，Lancer，艾蕾什基加勒，乃是苏美尔神话的冥界女神。”"}
{"time": 1769709740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936002449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B07702BB4F94369DD999764B42427078.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTSRAznOHnEzrqzrmuBQ8GXa-wXvxjIvAwg_wool8Kzw6qxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ5foXuqKAQUo4uPMkBCFRUnoCJTqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMO1vX90DKK4iWP_nk439Dh008D9f0qY-XPIbNk_Caje02r4VWp-92B7x-mApy5mYig,file_size=204360]"}
{"time": 1769709750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95841829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "说着艾蕾还撩动了一下发梢，扬起金色的波浪。"}
{"time": 1769709833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317567745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1712212330]“圣杯这种东西我也没兴趣，主要是圣杯战争的过程，这种无法预测的舞台才令人兴奋！”"}
{"time": 1769709836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47528410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，所谓女神就是这样。\""}
{"time": 1769709843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882345763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "弗朗西斯卡笑嘻嘻地回应。"}
{"time": 1769709872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821941256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100狂信子对弗朗西斯卡的第一印象\nrd100艾蕾对弗朗西斯卡的第一印象"}
{"time": 1769709963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096736249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。r2#d100"}
{"time": 1769709963, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2096736249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100= \n75\n29"}
{"time": 1769710031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241611598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子对于这种不追求圣杯的魔术师第一印象都还可以。\n而艾蕾可能是因为刚才被猜错了职阶所以第一印象有些差。"}
{"time": 1769710095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569083767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过圣杯战争现在还是处于赝品阶段，按照我的计划，在今晚Saber被召唤出来之后，应该就能引出真正的圣杯战争了！”"}
{"time": 1769710176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726925739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“距离晚上还有一段时间，到时候我会通知莉维娅亲Saber的召唤地点，要去看看吗？可能是熟人哦～”"}
{"time": 1769710194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036510579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"果然你才是主谋吧？还要把我也卷进来。\"无语地叹了口气，\"嗯?这倒是有意思，在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1769710382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114746926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在一座老旧的歌剧院，地址是XXX，到时候我会发信息给你，到晚上这段时间我还有事，要不莉维娅亲你先逛一逛雪原市？”"}
{"time": 1769710416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574290358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“如果能遇到其他主从就更好了，真想看莉维娅亲和其他主从互动呢～”"}
{"time": 1769710442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455290342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行吧～那我们就暂且寒暄到这里。此外——\"白了他一眼，\"我们算是合作吗？\""}
{"time": 1769710459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129717276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说回来，与冥界女神小姐你有渊源的从者真是不少，不知道后续还会不会出现更多。”"}
{"time": 1769710535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989303474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“如果说看在朋友关系上我们现在肯定是合作吧，不过我还没有召唤从者呢，后续也说不准。”"}
{"time": 1769710578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987252972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“反正我们两个也不会死，就算是后续敌对偶尔也算是挺有趣嘛！”"}
{"time": 1769710613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132328791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"愿望这种事确实说不准。\"伸展一下筋骨，\"你要是这么期望，我也不得不奉陪了。\"勾起嘴角，\"今晚见，我要回去休息了。\""}
{"time": 1769710762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6015325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "辞别了警察局，在回去的路上，莉维娅一行人还会发生什么事件？"}
{"time": 1769710903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "257186305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1/5/9、艾蕾说要逛一逛街买衣服\n2/6、某个二世的电话终于打通了\n3、偶遇弗拉特？\n4/8、无事发生\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769710933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609867362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769710933, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1609867362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=1"}
{"time": 1769711019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680192276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅酱，就一套衣服有点太少了，反正回去的路上也要路过商业街，正好给我们三个都买些新衣服吧。”"}
{"time": 1769711062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619885455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“尤其是Assassin小姐，穿着一身黑袍真是浪费了这张脸，多给她买点。”"}
{"time": 1769711084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408670228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，这不好吧…”\n狂信子有些脸红。"}
{"time": 1769711091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272675296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"点头，\"没问题，既然艾蕾都这么说了，一起一起。\""}
{"time": 1769711124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249797597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“估计也就今天下午能买了，后续开战起来就没这个闲工夫了。”"}
{"time": 1769711203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62903342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那众人很快就买好了各式各样的服饰，这里的店铺都有送货上门的服务，写明了酒店房间号，就有专人送达，所以不需要拎在手上。"}
{"time": 1769711234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796034163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅、艾蕾、狂信子都买了几件衣服？分别rd10"}
{"time": 1769711243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748742324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。r3#d10"}
{"time": 1769711243, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1748742324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10= \n6\n4\n5"}
{"time": 1769711256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266399193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还挺平均)"}
{"time": 1769711288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912225670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看来还是莉维娅买的最多，架不住艾蕾和狂信子一个劲儿地想看莉维娅试穿。"}
{"time": 1769711334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441372515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "愉快的时间总是短暂的，等会到酒店休息一段时间，吃过晚饭，也到了差不多预定的时间点。"}
{"time": 1769711357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399078061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "弗朗西斯卡也发来了消息，通知了莉维娅。"}
{"time": 1769711480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944557936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1769790421, "type": "reply", "message_id": "796497280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1769790524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656714376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅现在是如何给从者供魔的？"}
{"time": 1769790582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251001179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有)"}
{"time": 1769790788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403912500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1/5/9、万能的贤者之石了解一下\n2/6、炼金术人造灵脉，链接地脉魔力\n3/7、通过圣枪的概念链接星之内海大源供魔\n4/8、通过对第五法的部分模仿，借贷过去和未来自己的魔力。\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769790847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691003171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你不是通宵打洲？）"}
{"time": 1769790849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315116125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769790849, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1315116125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=3"}
{"time": 1769790855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126775415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我不可能通宵打)"}
{"time": 1769791196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528990721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "时间稍稍倒退到三人在水晶之丘魔术工坊休息之时。"}
{"time": 1769791219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865530673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯…果然还是不行呢～”"}
{"time": 1769791234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000524066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1769791265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619331473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沙发上的艾蕾突然脱力一般松松垮垮地抱着靠枕躺下。"}
{"time": 1769791330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251440937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“也不是什么特别的事啦莉维娅，就是…怎么说呢…”"}
{"time": 1769791353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394364150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=20DCADAA5B172FC6E5E4B7160B63D388.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSsVuQlz28XjO0FMO19hyBj4lTBNBiW6Qcg_woo6NuZx9qzkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ-_n1QGIxzBNZkb32bL0Pn3oCM7GCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMNGxqqZRtaKsq2mZvMte-6yWmTipA0D9PIqMBZeMJX6ZAJpOsAVJGiOMEZU5AnOKvw,file_size=128150]"}
{"time": 1769791390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012782291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦～\"稍微拖长音调，\"艾蕾亲?\""}
{"time": 1769791393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287342715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在美索不达米亚平原那个地方，我是能直接联系到冥府的。”"}
{"time": 1769791438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882704569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“毕竟当时神代环境下，冥府就是位于字面意义上的地下2万米深处。”"}
{"time": 1769791495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445965683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“现在如果要召唤冥府，施行我作为死亡女神的全部权能，必须要把宝具完全展开才行。”"}
{"time": 1769791557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814086435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“刚刚我突发奇想能不能把这个地方的地脉链接到冥府，但是失败了，不知道是现代神秘衰退的缘故还是这具身体不能完全发挥能力导致的。”"}
{"time": 1769791595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677055055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...很有可能。\"点点脑袋，\"毕竟这里是神秘衰退的现代，而且...\""}
{"time": 1769791612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338730287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“如果能把这个地方的地脉链接到冥府，那些在圣杯战争中意外死去的民众的灵魂就能保存下来了。”"}
{"time": 1769791647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286972801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这里也是远离美索不达米亚的土...\"停住话头，脸上浮现出笑容，\"诶，艾蕾亲真是温柔的女神啊。\""}
{"time": 1769791710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017657986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过也不是必须要地脉链接到冥府，如果有什么能够保存灵魂的东西，还必须是神造兵装那种级别的东西，凭这种东西我也能临时做出一个包围雪原市的小冥府就是了。”"}
{"time": 1769791753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799954752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过这种东西恐怕要找吉尔伽美什那家伙，我可不想看那家伙嚣张的脸。”"}
{"time": 1769791768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913778099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"指着自己，\"我也可以哦?\""}
{"time": 1769791806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811064657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾听到莉维娅夸奖的话之后有些害羞地扭过了头，但是脸上微微的红色出卖了她。"}
{"time": 1769791886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709685066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1913778099]“我知道莉维娅作为炼金术师很厉害啦，但是也不能凭空掏出这么符合当下条件的道具吧。”"}
{"time": 1769792090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006052049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，真是的。\"耸耸肩，把自己的胸针取下来，\"这就是哦?\""}
{"time": 1769792140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792431547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我看你这么久才回，一看就是刚打三角洲死了）"}
{"time": 1769792146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257893921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然只是仿品，不过至少拥有部分原品的功能。\"把胸针递给她，\"星之锚，怎么样?连吉尔伽美什王那里都没有这种东西吧？\""}
{"time": 1769792157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968226775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1792431547](否，我刚刚去拿可乐了)"}
{"time": 1769792161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586168794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我早就死了)"}
{"time": 1769792171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561704947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(死了有十分钟了)"}
{"time": 1769792336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199432737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那折木和龙怎么没死）"}
{"time": 1769792375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265347396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为我是，倒霉蛋)"}
{"time": 1769792844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1377130312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人呢)"}
{"time": 1769792977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077120981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（等下）"}
{"time": 1769792986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454988154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我在弄一个很新颖东西）"}
{"time": 1769793388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320687168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（好了）"}
{"time": 1769793399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333519228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(okk)"}
{"time": 1769793430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082856495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1257893921]“这是…星之锚的影子！你从哪搞来的莉维娅？”"}
{"time": 1769793434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32572137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=7729DA500C7BE5D9B6AA92B3174246F3.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRKSv4cxYnvPTRhGkDkjqpVwUks2hiFhwEg_woo97rGp-KzkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAoNt8-RSMx_MIR6vMb_JvHoCj76CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMFf4K871b8C2X1V79d4iu4jAj7C-vAf5CHo_M9JOPzjLtuLvhAEvUCCm0rHopRP2wQ,file_size=17285]"}
{"time": 1769793443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76102787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾一脸惊讶的表情"}
{"time": 1769793459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298088892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是)"}
{"time": 1769793461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159281654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(表情差分)"}
{"time": 1769793508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303397993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我看看…是货真价实的东西，确实有着保存灵魂的功能。”"}
{"time": 1769793525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475372133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘻嘻～怎么了，我就知道艾蕾一定会惊讶的，怎么样?当初可是在盖亚的眼皮底下复制出来的\""}
{"time": 1769793539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577268725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“就连吉尔伽美什那家伙也可能没有这东西吧，还真是神通广大呢莉维娅酱，多谢了呢！”"}
{"time": 1769793579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728489993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=18285A479EE9519C02D2A18196BB5CF3.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQpKmx2m-azZYnB9DdsqSI_WtP5MxiYiwEg_woo-pLd7OKzkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQOxPyjmvfYBjDUoAOdz-I33oCI7aCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMFf4K871b8C2X1V79d4iu4jAj7C-vAf5CHo_M9JOPzjLtuLvhAEvUCCm0rHopRP2wQ,file_size=17816]"}
{"time": 1769793637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956286056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟是艾蕾温柔的请求，我也不能藏私呢。\"含笑点头，\"真是的，冥界女神是这种温柔的性格，大家都会急着去死的。\""}
{"time": 1769793677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360607569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我先把我的道具和你的星锚之影连接起来，到时候再连接雪原市的地脉行了！这下就不会有无辜群众死伤了！”"}
{"time": 1769793712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031989800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=956286056]“就…就算你这么夸奖我，我也不会高兴的！这毕竟是我的职责。”"}
{"time": 1769793746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214059486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5B69D830DB5C2A669B6952C6C40C603F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSTIRrnNzxr1fHR5Pc52jH3V3b69xjdhQEg_woo88KmvOOzkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQmeHeK7B5CWLCAMiGh49TZXoCoIaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMFf4K871b8C2X1V79d4iu4jAj7C-vAf5CHo_M9JOPzjLtuLvhAEvUCCm0rHopRP2wQ,file_size=17117]"}
