{"time": 1769794850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050937390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "今晚的歌剧院并没有表演看，但是内部还是有几扇窗户亮着灯。"}
{"time": 1769794892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855883326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看邀请自己观看的家伙在哪的同时，自己走进去看看"}
{"time": 1769794984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399187931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅一行人选择从什么入口进入？\n1/5/9、锁住的正门\n2/6、背后的员工通道\n3/7、走窗户\n4/8、侧面的安全消防通道\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769795100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472255994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769795100, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1472255994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=4"}
{"time": 1769795134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711047092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们走安全通道吧，真是...\"扶了扶额，\"邀请我来这里，连通道都没有准备。\""}
{"time": 1769795242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638791601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“今晚没表演，正门是锁着的，也没有办法嘛～”\n艾蕾安抚到。"}
{"time": 1769795402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750654501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人沿着消防通道进入歌剧院，内部的通道因为没有开灯，而显得有些阴森，有些木质地板因为年久失修，踩上去有嘎吱的声音。"}
{"time": 1769795404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998960880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，不过这个点这里还有人吗？\"走进去，手心捧起一团光芒照明"}
{"time": 1769795551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549405259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "有了亮光的，莉维娅很快就发现了墙上的内部地图，这座歌剧院内部有着一座主厅和一个副厅，主厅比较大，有着4层观剧层，观众可以有一个良好的观剧视野。"}
{"time": 1769795671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992340002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "既然是叫自己来观剧，那自然向着观剧层走去，\"这里也没有其他人的样子\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1769795710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682368935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "临近主厅，就在推开一扇门就能进入主厅之时。"}
